  "notes": "RS-485 device: reach it through a Modbus RTU-to-TCP gateway using the factory serial settings above (slave address 1, 9600 bps, 8N1). Source: CHINT 'DTSU666/DSSU666 User Manual' ZTW0.464.0104 V1, table 11 (Modbus protocol address table). Measurements and energy counters are IEEE-754 single precision floats with the high word first (ABCD), read with function code 03. The manual gives the value resolution (0.1 V, 0.001 A, 0.1 W, 0.001 PF, 0.01 Hz, 1 kWh), which is applied here as the scale factor. The register numbers in the manual are the wire addresses."
